    Takes inputs: {'entity_name': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Exact name of the entity (e.g. "peer group").'}}
    Returns an output of type: integer
- get_entity_category_tool: Fetch the category string (e.g. "index", "company") for an entity.
    Takes inputs: {'entity_name': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Human entity name.'}}
    Returns an output of type: string
- list_years_tool: Return every calendar year represented in the database.
    Takes inputs: {}
    Returns an output of type: array
- get_year_id_tool: Convert a calendar year into its surrogate primary-key ID.
    Takes inputs: {'year': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Calendar year (e.g. ``2011``).'}}
    Returns an output of type: integer
- get_return_series_value_tool: Retrieve a numeric datapoint from the *return_series* table.
    Takes inputs: {'entity_id': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Primary-key ID for the entity.'}, 'year_id': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Primary-key ID for the calendar year.'}, 'series_type': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Series type to fetch (e.g. "cumulative", "price").'}}
    Returns an output of type: number
- compute_percentage_change_tool: Compute the percentage change from *start_value* to *end_value*.
    Takes inputs: {'start_value': {'type': 'number', 'description': 'Baseline value.'}, 'end_value': {'type': 'number', 'description': 'Comparison value.'}}
    Returns an output of type: number
